Subject: drm/amd/display: Fix warnings
To: stable@vger.kernel.org
Cc: Clay King <clayking@amd.com>, Dillon Varone <dillon.varone@amd.com>, James Lin <pinglei.lin@amd.com>, Daniel Wheeler <daniel.wheeler@amd.com>, Alex Deucher <alexander.deucher@amd.com>, Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
